    mine form, like dock-take-mark-private
      site private
    mine form, like dock-take-mark-deprecated
      site deprecated
    mine form, like dock-take-mark-experimental
      site experimental

mine dock-take-mark-private
  mine term, term mark
    mine term, term private

mine dock-take-mark-deprecated
